    "reviews": "\u201cMillennia\u2019s gameplay is compelling enough to keep me coming back.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 The Gamer<br><br>\u201cAn exciting, complex Civ-like that blends familiarity with innovation.\u201d<br>Wargamer<br><br>\u201cThe replay value is really high, it will definitely stay on my drive\u201d<br>79/100 \u2013 Gamestar<br>",
